---
description: Logs, metrics, and traces must stay free of secrets and unbounded labels.
globs: app/observability/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# Observability

- Log function records as one JSON object. Include the lifecycle stage that ran.
- Redact bearer tokens and passwords. Do not log raw tokens or password hashes.
- Prometheus labels are method, route template, status, feature, and function id.
- Do not use player id, session id, or request id as a metric label.
- Sample or aggregate game ticks. Do not write a database row per tick.
- Sentry export runs only when `SENTRY_DSN` is set.

```text
Bad:  Counter("requests", ["player_id"])
Good: Counter("ros_http_requests_total", ["method", "path", "status"])
```
